dsl metta

Concept Command as component

	Concept Status
		sub Visible
		sub Invisible
		sub Readonly

		has Condition	

	sub EditionCommand
		sub DraftEditing

	sub DocumentCommand
		sub Edit
		sub Sign > def string label = empty
		sub Seal

	sub CollectionCommand

		sub Download
			def string label
			
			Concept Format 
				facet Csv
				facet Tsv
				facet Xlsx > def resource template
				facet Docx > def resource template
				facet Pdf > def resource template

		sub Filtering
			def string tag
			def string label
			def string defaultValue = empty
			def word:{Number Text Date} type = Text

		sub Grouping
			def string tag
			def word:{Ascending Descending} mode = Ascending

			facet Type
				sub Text
				sub Date
					def word:{Seconds Minutes Hours Days Months Years} resolution

		sub Sorting
			def string tag
			def string label = empty
			def word:{Ascending Descending} mode = Ascending
			def word:{Number Text Date} type = Text
